&P254853 = CDLI Literary 000577, ex. 001 
#atf: lang sux 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. a-sza3 PA?-am3{ki} x [...] GAN2#-am3 
#tr.en: (A plot in?) the ... field, which consists of ... iku 
>>Q000577 001
2. esz2#-gar3 {d}en-lil2 u3 {d}nin-urta 
#tr.en: The land assigned to Enlil and Ninurta 
>>Q000577 002
3. sza3-bi!-ta 3(bur'u) GAN2-am3 
#tr.en: From among this(!) 30 bur3 
>>Q000577 003
4. kur6 lu2-NIG2-PAD-e-ne 
#tr.en: (is) the ration (providing land)/share of the (temples'?) requisitioners(!?) 
>>Q000577 004
5. e!?-bi?-sze3 sahar 2(iku) GAN2 x-a 
#tr.en: Towards its embankment(?), earth (was piled?), 2 iku ... 
>>Q000577 005
6. al-ta ba-dub2 erin2!?-ta x-ze2#? 
#tr.en: Was struck by the hoe and cleared of (weeds)(?) by the workforce(?) 
>>Q000577 006
7. kinx?(TUK)-sze3! SAR a sza3-gu4 lu2-engar-bi nu-gal2? 
#tr.en: (But) in order to do the work (of plowing)(?) ... there are not drover(s) or plowmen/farmer(s) present(?) 
>>Q000577 007
8. iq-bi2-sum2 u3 a-bi!?-x-x 
#tr.en: Iqbisum and ... 
>>Q000577 008
9. inim mu-e-de!-gar-re-esz 
#tr.en: made a legal claim about (the portion of the field or the lack of procured labor?) 
>>Q000577 009
10. tukum-bi lugal-gu10 
#tr.en: If this  to my king,
>>Q000577 010
11. an-na-du10 
#tr.en: is amenable,
>>Q000577 011
12. ra-gaba hu-mu-un-gi4-gi4 
#tr.en: he should send a rider (to this effect) 
>>Q000577 012
@reverse 
1. kin2#? ak bulugx(BUR2?) a-sza3-ga-bi? 
#tr.en: The working(?) and boundary stakes(?) of the field 
2. KA KA? KA mu-ni-ib!?-x-x-NE? 
#tr.en: He will ... 
$ blank space

