#tr.en: Supreme vizier of mother Bau, who engenders the life of the king 
3. ra-gaba ku3 an-sza3-ta dub nam-ti-la-na e11#-de3 
#tr.en: Pure rider, bringing her tablet of life down from the midst of heaven 
