13. {d}nin-ninna2 sur2-du3{muszen}-gin7 ha-ba-zi-ge-en 
#tr.en: Therefore I was arising like a harrier and a falcon 
14. nibru{ki}-sze3! a-la-ga2 ha-DI-ku4-re 
