9. e2 an-sze3 kur-ra-am3 ki-sze3 idim-ma-am3 
#tr.en: Temple, towards the sky it is a mountain, towards the earth it is a spring 
10. e2 an-ki-a 3(disz)-kam-ma-bi-nam 
