35. [...]-AD?-TAG{ki}-a ki-tusz ki ag2-ga2-ni giri3 kur2! ba#?-ra#-[...] 
#tr.en: She wandered away from(!) Sirara, her beloved dwelling 
36. [...] gul#-la e2 gul-la-gu10 gig-ga-bi im#-[me] 
