38. [...] ge6-par4-ta ba-da-gur ki-erim2-e ba#-ab-du11# 
#tr.en: The en priest(ess) turned away from(?) the gipar, enemy territory ... 
@reverse 
1. [...]-x {d}nanna-ka a2 dugud ba-szi-in-de2 
