#tr.en: The Eunir temple, the shrine that had raised its head like heaven(?), (its) protective aegis(?) ... 
$ blank space 
8. ka2 gu-la ka2 igi pirig-ga2 ki# nam tar-ra lu2-erim2-[...] {gesz}ig-bi-ne ba-ab-[...] 
