#tr.en: Kahegal and Igiḫegal, the doorkeepers of the temple ... 
$ blank space 
10. [e2]-mah#? {d}en-ki-ke4 ki u3#-di du7-a gesztu2 kalam-ma#? [...] 
#tr.en: (At) the Emah temple of Enki, a place suitable for awe, the wisdom of the land ... 
