3. ni2-zu nig2-ka9-ra nu-ra-gal2-la-ta 
#tr.en: After you yourself were not present for(?) the account 
4. in gi4-me-a-asz-gu10-ne ga-bi2-ib-du11 bi2-du11-a-ta 
