12. in-nu szesz tur-ra-zu-ne#-sze3 sigx(NIG2)?-ge-ne-eb# 
#tr.en: It has not (previously been the case?)! (Now) assimilate with your “little brothers” 
13. nam#-lu2-lux(URU) gaszam#-[...] ma-da tusz-a 
