&P349957 = CDLI Literary 000323 OB Catalogue from Ur 1 
#atf: lang sux 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. lugal-e mu-ni nig2-ul-sze3 
#tr.en: The king, in order to make his name manifest as something of ancient duration. 
# incipit of Shulgi B 
>>Q000396 001 
2. ARAD-{d}suen lugal 
#tr.en: Warad-Sîn, king/Warad-Sîn, my? king(?) 
# unidentified incipit 
3. i3-na-ab i-me-a 
#tr.en: The city of Inab existed but the city of Kiritab did not. 
# incipit of Marriage of Martu 
>>Q000354 001 
4. gurusz# lu2 szir3 ra-ra 
#tr.en: The youth, the one who laments/is lamented(?) ... 
# unidentified incipit 
5. en3-bar gurun-na 
#tr.en: The young reed growth(?) ... in(?) fruit/flower ... 
6. sa 
#tr.en: Net(?). 
# incipit of an unidentified lexical text? 
7. {d}suen-i-din-na lugal 
#tr.en: Sîn-iddinam, king/Sîn-iddinam, my? king(?) 
8. di4-lax(ME) u4-da 
#tr.en: Tiny ones(?), if we do not do our work?. 
# incipit of Dialog 2? 
9. izi 
#tr.en: Fire. 
# incipit of the lexical series Izi 
10. in-nin me husz-a 
#tr.en: Lady of the furious cosmic powers, bearing an aura, riding the great cosmic powers. 
# incipit of Inanna and Ebih 
>>Q000339 001 
11. me-ta-am3 me-a di-id-ti 
#tr.en: Where, where are (you) going?. 
# incipit of Dialog 5? 
12. sza3 {gi}pisan x sza-ap-lu-um 
#tr.en: Contents of the basket of the lower ... 
13. lugal-e mu-ni nig2-ul-sze3 
#tr.en: The king, in order to make his name manifest as something of ancient duration. 
# incipit of Shulgi B 
>>Q000396 001 
14. en-e# kur lu2 ti-la# 
#tr.en: The lord resolved to go to the mountain that sustains man. 
# incipit of Gilgamesh and Huwawa A 
>>Q000365 001 
@reverse 
1. u4 husz!? an-ur2-ru 
#tr.en: Furious(?) storm ... the horizon(?) 
# unidentified incipit 
2. ia# lu2-lu7 
#tr.en: One who shines with oil(?). 
# incipit of Gilgamesh and Huwawa B(?) 
>>Q000366 001 
3. nin mul-an-gin7 
#tr.en: Lady who is variegated like a heavenly star 
# incipit of Nisaba A 
>>Q000733 001 
4. e2 E husz! an-NA 
#tr.en: House, furious storm(!?) of the universe(!?). 
# incipit of Nungal hymn? 
>>Q000736 001 
5. ugu-gu10 
#tr.en: My upper skull 
# the lexical series ugu-mu 
6. lugal-banda3{+da} 
#tr.en: Lugalbanda came to a halt in the mountain, the distant place 
# Lugalbanda and the Anzu Bird 
>>Q000368 001 
7. u4 esz5-bar kin2 
#tr.en: The day/when/if a decision/oracle ... 
# unidentified incipit 
8. u4 ul-la 
#tr.en: The one who sows since ancient time was the one who instructed his son. 
# incipit of Farmer's Instructions 
>>Q000785 001 
9. ma2-gurx(TE) nig2 giri17-zal 
#tr.en: The barge, that of joy(?) ... 
# unidentified incipit 
10. dumu e2-dub-ba-a 
#tr.en: Son of the eduba'a school. 
# incipit of several compositions 
>>Q000754 001? 
>>Q000756 001? 
>>Q000758 001? 
