24. sipa {d}ri-im-{d}suen nam-en-bi an {d}en-lil2-la2 ki he2-ag2-e-ne 
#tr.en: So that An and Enlil shall love the lordship of shepherd Rīm-Sîn 
>>Q000509 053
25. lu2-szir3-ra-ke4 za3-mi2-zu ka-bi-a mi-ni-ib-du10-ge-ne 
