>>Q000509 054
26. {d}ha-ia3 lu2-szir3-ra-ke4 za3-mi2-zu ka-bi-a mi-ni-ib-du10-ge-ne 
#tr.en: Haya, the singers shall make your praise sweet in their(?) mouths 
>>Q000509 055
27. en an-ki lugal abzu-a za3-mi2-bi mah-a 
